              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The unit is composed of a tarasnices and two crewmen. Crewmen have hand weapons. Tarasnices count as light bolt throwers as described page 129 of Warhammer Ancient Battles. You may have up to 1 Tarasnices gun per every two war wagons or wagon tabors fielded in your army.</characteristic>
